<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>You already have an account</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f5;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .brand {
      padding: 32px 40px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f4f4f5;
    }
    .brand-name {
      font-size: 1.1em;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #000000;
    }
    .body {
      padding: 36px 40px;
    }
    .body h1 {
      font-size: 1.45em;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #000000;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .body p {
      font-size: 0.97em;
      color: #52525b;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .body p strong {
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .notice {
      margin: 24px 0;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: #fafafa;
      border-left: 3px solid #000000;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .notice p {
      font-size: 0.92em;
      color: #3f3f46;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #f4f4f5;
      margin: 28px 0 0;
    }
    .actions {
      margin: 28px 0 8px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      margin: 0 8px 8px 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .button-primary {
      background: #000000;
      color: #ffffff !important;
    }
    .button-secondary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #000000 !important;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 20px 40px 28px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }
    .footer p {
      font-size: 0.82em;
      color: #a1a1aa;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="brand-name">Tesseract</span>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <h1>You already have an account</h1>
      <p>Hi,</p>
      <p>Someone tried to create a Tesseract account with this email. Since you already have one, we didn't create another.</p>
      <p>If it was you, sign in to your account. If you don't remember your password, you can reset it.</p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="{{loginUrl}}">Sign in</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="{{forgotPasswordUrl}}">Reset password</a>
      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        <p>If it wasn't you, you can safely ignore this email: your account hasn't changed.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">
      <p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 0.88em; color: #a1a1aa;">
        The Tesseract team
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This message was sent automatically by Tesseract. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
